  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">빛 단원을 도입했던 것 공유해봅니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">재과만에서 소개해주셨던 그림자 공연 영상이 좋아서 이걸 먼저 보여줍니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ned6eeCGl4A\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ned6eeCGl4A</a> </span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ned6eeCGl4A\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bphYBd/dJMb8T91Qc3/MIdfBS1bZ7GaExGIJkcyAK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/4V6pw/dJMb88F7g9Y/KkFexPXHOy2k5fHwbbaGM1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bdhcOa/dJMb8WMrVWk/mNwxoeglYG9ufITXWV0WGk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ned6eeCGl4A\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">아이들이 정말 신기하다며 집중해서 잘 봅니다.&#160;그 다음 초성퀴즈로 그림자를 맞춥니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b1c5a3ee3dc7f1feecd342b54eda43e8d2c69aa9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b1c5a3ee3dc7f1feecd342b54eda43e8d2c69aa9\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그렇다면 그림자 관련 재밌는 퀴즈!</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">지금 보여주는 사진 중 선생님이 조작한 사진 하나가 있어요. 맞춰보세요~</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">라고 하고 사진을 보여주면 </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">아이들이 호기심 어린 눈으로 바라봅니다.</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&#8203;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7ba8b0bd97c40e17a8934fba3c694d331422ce5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7ba8b0bd97c40e17a8934fba3c694d331422ce5\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">자, 1번이랑 2번 중 진짜 사진은 뭘까? 얘기하지말고 손만 들어보라고 하면&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&#8203;</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2번이 많은 반도 있었습니다 ㅎㅎ</span></span><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/75308c891727a530956c7c94c828ea661c7acfb4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/75308c891727a530956c7c94c828ea661c7acfb4\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">한 문제 더! 이 문제는 1번에서 손을 많이 들었습니다.</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이때 확신에 차서 1번이 정답이라 손 든 아이를 비웃고 있는 눈빛을 발견하고, </span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그 학생에게 왜 2번이 정답인지 설명해보라고 하면서 자연스럽게 그림자의 정의에 도달하며 빛으로 들어갔습니다.</span><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3e6037e1567944f2998db9eb330750247fa031b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3e6037e1567944f2998db9eb330750247fa031b\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/222020a5333532f9b26991589d02d4d8f3585a89\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/222020a5333532f9b26991589d02d4d8f3585a89\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">물체를 보는 것에 대해 설명하기 전에&#160;</span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">어렸을 때 화장실에 들어갔는데 문 잠근 밖에서 불을 끈 동생이 장난쳐 화장실 갇힌 사건 경험을 이야기하며.. </span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">과연 불이 꺼진 화장실 안에 있으면... 시간이 지나면 보일까?라는 질문을 던집니다.</span></span></p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7bc4b95b9f577cca3bd4f43719f8895c811d06c3\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"540\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7bc4b95b9f577cca3bd4f43719f8895c811d06c3\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/336f6d17522c48419d85b9cf2523670ccf45e844\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"540\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/336f6d17522c48419d85b9cf2523670ccf45e844\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a2a5acaa28421419504789e4853a581fc62f4f9\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"540\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a2a5acaa28421419504789e4853a581fc62f4f9\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6d0a95685e133d58f89811c0e6e3e562d589da74\" data-origin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"540\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6d0a95685e133d58f89811c0e6e3e562d589da74\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">아이들은 시간이 지나면 보일 것이라 답합니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">그렇다면 물체는 어떻게 보는 걸까? 라며 단원을 도입했습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">+ 눈에서 희미하게 빛이 나온다는 학생에겐 예전 막장드라마라고 신기생뎐에 나온 장면 하나를...</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6cfd2d9b6cecce8fd9f85a27601c9acf391cd70\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6cfd2d9b6cecce8fd9f85a27601c9acf391cd70\" data-origin-width=\"444\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
